  <item>
    <title>13.够了！受够了！我们得整点儿阳间的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663e23950fcd82a7c9de8845</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663e23950fcd82a7c9de8845</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 May 2024 13:39:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期分享梨甜和饼干在无尽的阴间生活里挤出来的一点阳间调味剂！无限回味，尸体升温，4️⃣人微活…3¥%…*…（%&amp;*）*</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHsLDfuQhDZZkX_eRjymoxW9vAp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阳间轶闻播报·一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">1:40</a> 男子强奸女子未遂被反杀，家人锐评：“罪有应得。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间轶闻播报·二</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">2:14</a> 超雄男烧杀掠抢遭警方击毙，父母泪目当场道谢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间轶闻播报·三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">7:29</a> 很难不猜想有人会在点给胖猫的外卖上备注一句“先生大义！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a> 2024感动中国人物竟是____？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 够了！受够了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间新发现·一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> 事实上，被选择的一直都是雄性（男的）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 女性的拥有的选择权包括——不选择男性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 梨甜奶奶名言：你看这村儿里面啊…只有剩下的男的，没有剩下的女的</span></p><span></span><p><span>对此我们一致认为：女士大义！</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间新发现·二</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 女生相亲对话新思路：顺着他聊，及时了解男人真内核（便于撒腿就跑）</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间新发现·三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 金靖怀孕采访出真章，让情感在人生的旷野中复位，传播阳间女性正能量</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间场景碎片合集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 饼干：在春夏交接的非机动车道上骑共享单车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 梨甜：阳光明媚的上午，在树荫下静静坐着的那个瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 车道上相接的树冠、我很喜欢的绿色、洒在柏油路上影影绰绰的阳光</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll2DEV_m2gAmsMTg4R2gdJsMitS8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> 梨甜：乌兰察布的空气治好了我的肺管子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYeTcbFQ-3272w38LFGaXLRsRHO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 饼干：和两个小姐妹每周一度的春游日，听着优雅bgm暴骑四轮观光车，好像人生已经掌握了红酒杯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkoY6pmz6we3CNsJd3fprBVghHv3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> 梨甜：和对象竞赛背人。（饼干建议录入上期胜负欲专题节目）</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间生物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 汪崽——荣登本期节目封面的小狗麻豆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbhy7W8F7F_6KOy4RN9SGKGHMKZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 聪明小狗的超绝学习力</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间美味合集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 饼干倾情推荐——北京三里屯壶茶火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 一条插播！梨甜钓到狗鱼啦！（不是用来吃的，是用来心里美的！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 梨甜倾情推荐——乌兰察布的羊肉、中国人的奶酪（能喝的奶酪）</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间饼干idea</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 成为同性恋红娘，把想谈恋爱的女的和女的凑到一起，男的和男的凑到一起，不想谈恋爱的自己呆着，公然排挤异性恋。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> 异性恋恶果——会生孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span>阳间拉拉之妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 此处推荐一个花小雕的视频：【我背着妈搞姬，妈背着我找T【闪零做客Vol.7】-哔哩哔哩】 </span><a href="https://b23.tv/k0rox55" data-url="https://b23.tv/k0rox55"><span>b23.tv</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>阳间结尾曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> 一首阳间之歌《这条小鱼在乎》送给大家～～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期bgm list：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头/间奏：Have Another One-Marc Torch</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：这条小鱼在乎-王OK/洪佩瑜</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️节目声明：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本台观点只代表此刻时间，不代表任何本人。</span></p>]]></description>
