    <title>06.人真的不能上班！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642c3184a79cc814709fac4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642c3184a79cc814709fac4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大！家！好！久！不！见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（插播一条题外广告）最近忙着整了个自媒体账号，名字叫「当代露丝」，主要是做女性内容，感兴趣的话可以去b站、抖音、小红书、视频号搜索关注我们的内容哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>回归正题！本期吐槽职场！主要是因为梨甜最近为了讨口饭吃，去做了两个项目的freelancer…再一次体验到了在职场打工的水深火热…不吐不快，直接听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part One 假职业批斗会</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">5:50</a> 从下午六点开到凌晨两点的废话会议让我感到了生命的流逝。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 我敬业！我职业！我虽然没有产出，但我就是不走，我带着拖鞋住公司。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 职场摩擦力，倚靠他人展现职业感。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Two 社畜求而不得的话语权</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 平等沟通已经被妖魔化成为挑战话语权。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 领导用10秒钟看完同事找了1天的reference。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 两个（几个）职能部门互相配合会有权力制约，本来应该是不同职能部门之间互相协调帮助，但最后通常会变成打仗。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Three 玄幻流窜的决定权</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 到底谁是老大？？？！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> 到底是谁给我结钱啊？？？！！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part Four 职场假象</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 我们追求的全都是泡沫！（这也是我们一直在休假的原因）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 工作只有完成，没有好坏。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a> 一个Flag和一些不太礼貌的吐槽…（别听！别听！别听！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期bgm list：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头：the job song-贝卡</span></p><span></span><p><span>间奏：Have Another One-Marc Torch</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：人生浪费指南-夏日入侵企画</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️节目声明</span></p><span></span><p><span>本台观点只代表此刻时间，不代表任何本人。</span></p>]]></description>
